    "$t": "台文通訊BONG報372期-封面作品：台語文化班"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><b><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span>主題</span><span>：</span></span></b></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台語文化班</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /><b>說明</b></span><b style=\"font-size: x-large; text-align: left;\">：</b></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">臺南市台語文化班學會舉辦ê台語文化班，由理事長黃良成校長擔任講師，按拜一到拜五，tī台南市各行政區上課，目前拜一是東區、拜二是永康區、拜三是安南區、拜四是善化區、拜五新化區。未來拜六ē tī南區開辦，預定3月底開班。另外由資深學員主講--ê iáu有拜一tī歸仁區kah拜三tī麻豆區ê課程。相片是2/4永康區上課ê畫面，學員讀《台文通訊BONG報》了後做伙hip相。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>歡迎逐家做伙來學習&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span><a href=\"https://reurl.cc/vQnY5k\" target=\"_blank\">https://reurl.cc/vQnY5k</a></span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhkb44_SO25vgmiuV8-eNZak9E84_pRULcDIGlM9SXcmYSnTabEj00s1_ZY1OwEYlVq6ae7NbA1KT3fkk1I0-93yINOB1N2SwXPghWbMhhBqnIz2d_gWFBrPLJZdNWnl1rO9H3jrtSHEtYjBMiojrJBdV2WhbiLDZ6he9EA0MU8ZYSNFDKCiDbUMiW_rPds/s3456/06-IMG20250204203205.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"2062\" data-original-width=\"3456\" height=\"382\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhkb44_SO25vgmiuV8-eNZak9E84_pRULcDIGlM9SXcmYSnTabEj00s1_ZY1OwEYlVq6ae7NbA1KT3fkk1I0-93yINOB1N2SwXPghWbMhhBqnIz2d_gWFBrPLJZdNWnl1rO9H3jrtSHEtYjBMiojrJBdV2WhbiLDZ6he9EA0MU8ZYSNFDKCiDbUMiW_rPds/w640-h382/06-IMG20250204203205.jpg\" width=\"640\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><br /></div><p></p></div><a name='more'></a><p></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjv7shiEFWTCy9-wJIrUfe2CSgce8igCpw_wTlmDlLw2Ta2bQbmvtjau5Z6EmJCk9V2_7FGFDItDdagbmVRMJDo__tGZhJMkd2ZR0BuvdmMs04hAAb08Cgk8vs0aExzyAHp6wKPcdN5OTHnXNOXZHTM0Bvd0PHQzafyBTCiTqsJRH_deNaIAVM10GwjptvT/s1424/372%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjv7shiEFWTCy9-wJIrUfe2CSgce8igCpw_wTlmDlLw2Ta2bQbmvtjau5Z6EmJCk9V2_7FGFDItDdagbmVRMJDo__tGZhJMkd2ZR0BuvdmMs04hAAb08Cgk8vs0aExzyAHp6wKPcdN5OTHnXNOXZHTM0Bvd0PHQzafyBTCiTqsJRH_deNaIAVM10GwjptvT/w450-h640/372%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br /></span></b></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl gpro0wi8 q66pz984 b1v8xokw\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8Abong%E5%A0%B1?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZWDjUJsSxaPbx9rBf3emvc0qX31sZFFUgNNqOtI9vv64OwqXsGEcwI3lw-EjolqeunKDULXB2AzmrXPdDewdlrZi72lKhnFv6ZPAhhxYvK8KMzXeD-ekv7Y_z6BLYVkK4MlRank2JL7XQR1R13adh_SDiIvZcpr6jdEpFHPKpL2oc7EsEvYcOny0uZTPG13xlE&amp;__tn__=